# The injected script and its String.raw template are byte-sensitive: a CRLF
# rewrite of a .mjs file changes what the page evaluates. Git was configured
# with autocrlf=true, which silently rewrote LF -> CRLF on checkout and emitted
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" for every file. Pin the line endings instead.
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.md  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.js  text eol=lf

# PowerShell is the one exception: pwsh handles LF fine, but a .ps1 that will be
# double-clicked or run through cmd on Windows is safer with CRLF.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
